.git
.gitignore
# Secrets and local state, at any depth. `npm run dev:server` keeps its data in packages/server/data, which holds
# the Claude login (claude/.credentials.json) and session tokens: it must never reach the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/data
**/*.tgz
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
**/dist-types
**/*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report
test-results
e2e/.auth
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
*.log
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
compose.yml
Caddyfile
